   "title": "Sinapi Aba golfers excel at 8th AGA Otumfour Invitational",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/sinapi-aba-golfers-excel-at-8th-aga-otumfour-invitational/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
   "published": "Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:54:57 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792450497.0,
   "ageDays": 0.15,
   "summary": "Sinapi Aba Savings and Loans recorded two notable results at the 8th AGA Otumfour Invitational, with Lydia Opoku Ware winning the ladies’ competition and Tony Appiah finishing runner-up in the men’s event. The annual tournament was held at the Royal Golf Club, bringing together 72 golfers from clubs across Ghana to compete for honours and strengthen ties within the golfing community.",
   "summary_zh": "Sinapi Aba Savings and Loans 在第八届 AGA Otumfour Invitational 赛事中取得了两项显著成绩，Lydia Opoku Ware 赢得女子组比赛，Tony Appiah 在男子组赛事中获得亚军。这项年度锦标赛在皇家高尔夫俱乐部举行，来自加纳各地俱乐部的 72 名高尔夫球手齐聚一堂，争夺荣誉并加强高尔夫社区内的联系。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Sinapi Aba Savings and Loans recorded two notable results at the 8th AGA Otumfour Invitational, with Lydia Opoku Ware winning the ladies’ competition and Tony Appiah finishing runner-up in the men’s event. The annual tournament was held at the Royal Golf Club, bringing together 72 golfers from clubs across Ghana to compete for honours and strengthen ties within the golfing community. The competition was played in the singles Stableford format, which awards points based on players’ scores on individual holes, with the highest total determining the winner. Opoku Ware’s victory in the ladies’ category was a highlight for Sinapi Aba Savings and Loans, while Appiah’s runner-up finish in the men’s competition added to the institution’s showing at the event. Beyond the competition, the AGA Otumfour Invitational provided an opportunity for golfers from different clubs to interact, build relationships and celebrate their shared interest in the sport. The annual event continues to combine sporting competition with fellowship, bringing together golfers from across the country",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "gh"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "pol"
   ],
   "tier": 4,
   "actor": "第三方",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "score": 0.6,
   "tag": "rss_myjoyonline",
   "title_zh": "Sinapi Aba高尔夫球手在第8届AGA Otumfour邀请赛中表现出色",
   "body_zh": "Sinapi Aba Savings and Loans 在第 8 届 AGA Otumfour Invitational 赛事中取得了两项显著成绩，Lydia Opoku Ware 赢得女子组比赛，Tony Appiah 在男子组比赛中获得亚军。这项年度锦标赛在皇家高尔夫俱乐部举行，来自加纳各地俱乐部的 72 名高尔夫球手齐聚一堂，争夺荣誉并加强高尔夫社区内的联系。比赛采用个人比洞稳定杆赛制，根据球员在单个球洞的得分给予积分，总分最高者获胜。Opoku Ware 在女子组的胜利是 Sinapi Aba Savings and Loans 的亮点，而 Appiah 在男子组的亚军成绩也提升了该机构在赛事中的表现。除了比赛之外，AGA Otumfour Invitational 为来自不同俱乐部的高尔夫球手提供了互动、建立关系并庆祝他们对这项运动共同兴趣的机会。这项年度赛事继续将体育竞赛与联谊相结合，汇聚了来自全国各地的高尔夫球手"
