   "title": "Obuasi SHTS: NDC reverses withdrawal directive, allows embattled chairman aspirant to contest",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/obuasi-shts-ndc-reverses-withdrawal-directive-allows-embattled-chairman-aspirant-to-contest/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
